      "text": "Order service, which is stateless\nreceive this traffic, hashes the incoming\nuser id and deterministically routes\nusers to a specific shard in our Redis\ncluster.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Order service, which is stateless\nreceive this traffic, hashes the incoming\nuser id and deterministically routes\nusers to a specific shard in our Redis\ncluster.\n",
