      "updated": 1778169310695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Order service on successful decrements, can publish a checkout\nevent to our message broker, Kafka, and return instantly a http\nstatus code of 202 to our client along with the queue ticket id.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Order service on successful decrements, can publish a checkout\nevent to our message broker, Kafka, and return instantly a http\nstatus code of 202 to our client along with the queue ticket id.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9dpJImOTceCw-UvFFC_jk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 148.31165360033435,
